165→function projectTemplate(name: string, id: string): string {
166→  return `# Brain: Project — "${name}"
167→
168→This directory maps to brain project \`${id}\`.
169→
170→**On first access**: Call \`get_project_context\` with \`project_id: "${id}"\` to load current decisions, active tasks, open questions, observations, and constraints before proceeding.
171→
172→When using Brain MCP tools from this directory:
173→- Pass \`project_id: "${id}"\` to project-scoped tools (\`get_active_decisions\`, \`get_architecture_constraints\`, \`get_recent_changes\`)
174→- Pass \`project: "${id}"\` to \`check_constraints\` before architectural changes
175→- Scope \`create_provisional_decision\` / \`ask_question\` with \`context: { project: "${id}" }\``;
176→}
